WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.605 --> 00:00:23.708
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hello, we have a reservation. The name is Ben Fischer.

2
00:00:30.356 --> 00:00:34.929
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Yes, here we are. A table for two?

3
00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:37.234
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, that’s right.

4
00:00:44.189 --> 00:00:46.802
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> OK, come this way.

5
00:00:47.532 --> 00:00:49.261
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Are you ready to order?

6
00:00:49.453 --> 00:00:54.180
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, I’ll have the soup and the mushroom ravioli, please.

7
00:01:03.248 --> 00:01:08.282
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’d like the mozzarella salad and then the chicken, please.

8
00:01:17.965 --> 00:01:20.501
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> What would you like to drink?

9
00:01:21.654 --> 00:01:23.537
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Just water for me.

10
00:01:30.338 --> 00:01:33.181
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> A bottle of mineral water, please.

11
00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:41.520
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Still or sparkling?

12
00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:44.171
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Is sparkling OK?

13
00:01:50.819 --> 00:01:52.855
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes, sparkling.

14
00:01:59.849 --> 00:02:01.270
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> How was your food?

15
00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:03.806
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It was great, thanks.

16
00:02:10.608 --> 00:02:12.491
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Really delicious.

17
00:02:18.984 --> 00:02:20.944
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Would you like a dessert?

18
00:02:20.944 --> 00:02:32.741
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No, thank you. Could we have the bill, please?

19
00:02:39.388 --> 00:02:40.387
<v><b>Waiter:</b></v> Of course.

20
00:02:40.387 --> 00:02:41.579
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thank you.